          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.77,
          "end": 14.103,
          "en": "which then does allow us to enter new expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.51,
          "end": 18.57,
          "en": "For that, of course, we have to work on this function here,",
