          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 78.63,
          "end": 81.18,
          "en": "so that Flutter internally, so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.18,
          "end": 83.31,
          "en": "can execute this function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.31,
          "end": 84.91,
          "en": "whenever this button is pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 86.34,
          "end": 89.76,
          "en": "Now inside of openAddExpenseOverlay,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 89.76,
          "end": 92.22,
          "en": "I now wanna execute some code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 92.22,
          "end": 94.47,
          "en": "that does open such an overlay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 94.47,
          "end": 98.1,
          "en": "And thankfully here we can use a built-in feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 98.1,
          "end": 101.7,
          "en": "If we type show here, we can get a long list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.7,
          "end": 103.53,
          "en": "of built-in functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 103.53,
          "end": 105.9,
          "en": "that are all provided by Flutter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 105.9,
          "end": 110.9,
          "en": "that we can call to show built-in UI elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 110.94,
          "end": 114.36,
          "en": "like a date picker or a dialogue box.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 114.36,
          "end": 116.67,
          "en": "And we'll see some of these things,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 116.67,
          "end": 120.06,
          "en": "for example, the date picker a little bit later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 120.06,
          "end": 123.06,
          "en": "Now here it's actually the modal bottom sheet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 123.06,
          "end": 124.53,
          "en": "which we want to show.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 124.53,
          "end": 128.19,
          "en": "So it's show modal bottom sheet, which we want to execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 128.19,
          "end": 132.15,
          "en": "inside of this openAddExpenseOverlay function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.15,
          "end": 135.51,
          "en": "And this show modal bottom sheet function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 135.51,
          "end": 137.19,
          "en": "is provided by a Flutter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 137.19,
          "end": 138.39,
          "en": "And hence it's available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 138.39,
          "end": 141.42000000000002,
          "en": "because of this material dart import,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 141.42000000000002,
          "end": 142.74,
          "en": "which as you can tell by now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 142.74,
          "end": 146.82,
          "en": "really unlocks many things, many widgets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 146.82,
          "end": 149.493,
          "en": "and also, for example, this utility function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 150.36,
          "end": 154.89,
          "en": "Now this function will dynamically add a new UI element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 154.89,
          "end": 159.03,
          "en": "such a modal overlay when it's being executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 159.03,
          "end": 160.95,
          "en": "And since I created it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 160.95,
          "end": 164.43,
          "en": "by using the suggestion whilst typing it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 164.43,
          "end": 167.43,
          "en": "my code editor automatically set it up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 167.43,
          "end": 172.26,
          "en": "to use two named arguments, context and builder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 172.26,
          "end": 174.57,
          "en": "to which we have to pass values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 174.57,
          "end": 177.66,
          "en": "when calling show modal bottom sheet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 177.66,
          "end": 180.51,
          "en": "Because these are two required arguments",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 180.51,
          "end": 183.693,
          "en": "that must be set when using this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 185.79,
          "end": 190.02,
          "en": "Now, context here wants a build context value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 190.02,
          "end": 192.36,
          "en": "For example, this context here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 192.36,
          "end": 196.29,
          "en": "which we get automatically as an input to the build method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 196.29,
          "end": 200.1,
          "en": "So which is passed to the build method by Flutter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 200.1,
          "end": 202.44,
          "en": "Here we're outside of the build method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 202.44,
          "end": 206.19,
          "en": "and yet there actually is a globally available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 206.19,
          "end": 210,
          "en": "context object, a context property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 210,
          "end": 213.06,
          "en": "that's made available by Flutter automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 213.06,
          "end": 216.15,
          "en": "since we're in a class that extends state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 216.15,
          "end": 218.67000000000002,
          "en": "When you're in a class that extends state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 218.67000000000002,
          "end": 221.97,
          "en": "Flutter automatically adds a context property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 221.97,
          "end": 224.49,
          "en": "to your class behind the scenes, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 224.49,
          "end": 227.37,
          "en": "It's provided by this state parent class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 227.37,
          "end": 230.67000000000002,
          "en": "And this context property that's made available by Flutter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 230.67000000000002,
          "end": 233.76,
          "en": "can be used as a value for this context argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 233.76,
          "end": 236.88,
          "en": "that must be set on show modal bottom sheet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 236.88,
          "end": 238.852,
          "en": "But for that, it's of course, important to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 238.852,
          "end": 241.98,
          "en": "what this context thing is all about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 241.98,
          "end": 245.79,
          "en": "And in the end, you can think of this context object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 245.79,
          "end": 250.79,
          "en": "this context value as some kind of metadata collection.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 251.13,
          "end": 255.54,
          "en": "An object full of metadata managed by Flutter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 255.54,
          "end": 258.21,
          "en": "that belongs to a specific widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 258.21,
          "end": 261.27,
          "en": "So every widget has its own context object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 261.27,
          "end": 264.12,
          "en": "and that contains metadata information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 264.12,
          "end": 267.45,
          "en": "related to the widget and very important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 267.45,
          "end": 271.92,
          "en": "related to the widgets position in the overall UI,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 271.92,
          "end": 274.47,
          "en": "in the overall widget tree.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 274.47,
          "end": 276.9,
          "en": "So this context value which we get here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 276.9,
          "end": 280.65,
          "en": "holds information about this expenses widget in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 280.65,
          "end": 283.65,
          "en": "and its position in the widget tree",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 283.65,
          "end": 286.803,
          "en": "as you'll also see if you hover over this context value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 288.09000000000003,
          "end": 290.97,
          "en": "Now this object, which is full of metadata,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 290.97,
          "end": 293.55,
          "en": "is required by show modal bottom sheet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 293.55,
          "end": 294.99,
          "en": "which is why you have to pass it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 294.99,
          "end": 297.93,
          "en": "as a value for the context argument here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 297.93,
          "end": 300.24,
          "en": "And the second argument that must be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 300.24,
          "end": 302.46,
          "en": "is another builder argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 302.46,
          "end": 305.43,
          "en": "And whenever you see an argument called builder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 305.43,
          "end": 306.87,
          "en": "it basically always means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 306.87,
          "end": 309.75,
          "en": "that you must provide a function as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 309.75,
          "end": 310.95,
          "en": "And here it's a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 310.95,
          "end": 312.72,
          "en": "that should return a widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 312.72,
          "end": 314.34,
          "en": "and that automatically gets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 314.34,
          "end": 317.91,
          "en": "one input value passed into it by Flutter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 317.91,
          "end": 321.03,
          "en": "which we'll call this builder function basically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 321.03,
          "end": 323.973,
          "en": "when it then tries to show this modal bottom sheet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 325.05,
          "end": 326.85,
          "en": "So here we can set up a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 326.85,
          "end": 328.95,
          "en": "which gets a context value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 328.95,
          "end": 332.52,
          "en": "And here I name this context parameters ctx",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 332.52,
          "end": 335.67,
          "en": "so that I don't clash with this context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 335.67,
          "end": 337.05,
          "en": "I could use the same name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 337.05,
          "end": 339.06,
          "en": "but technically it's a different context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 339.06,
          "end": 342.142,
          "en": "because it's the context of this modal bottom sheet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 342.142,
          "end": 343.95,
          "en": "that will be created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 343.95,
          "end": 346.62,
          "en": "So the information object related to that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 346.62,
          "end": 348.51,
          "en": "instead of the information object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 348.51,
          "end": 350.67,
          "en": "related to the expenses widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 350.67,
          "end": 352.863,
          "en": "and hence I choose a different name here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 353.94,
          "end": 356.22,
          "en": "And inside of this function body,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 356.22,
          "end": 360.24,
          "en": "you now to return your widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 360.24,
          "end": 362.37,
          "en": "that should basically be displayed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 362.37,
          "end": 364.92,
          "en": "when Flutter renders this modal bottom sheet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 364.92,
          "end": 366.84,
          "en": "that it's opening up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 366.84,
          "end": 368.55,
          "en": "And therefore, here we can again use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 368.55,
          "end": 371.85,
          "en": "this very short notation using this arrow syntax",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 371.85,
          "end": 375.15,
          "en": "since here we return that widget that should be shown.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 375.15,
          "end": 377.4,
          "en": "And to get something on the screen quickly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 377.4,
          "end": 380.79,
          "en": "I'll again use the text widget here as a placeholder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 380.79,
          "end": 383.01,
          "en": "and just say modal bottom sheet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 383.01,
          "end": 385.68,
          "en": "and add a semicolon at the end here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 385.68,
